WEBVTT

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:32.209
[Full-Time Magister 2]

00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:35.542
♪ The rising dawn
cuts through the night ♪

00:00:35.751 --> 00:00:38.460
♪ And destroys the darkness ♪

00:00:38.562 --> 00:00:42.549
♪ A new wing shall emerge ♪

00:00:43.003 --> 00:00:46.185
♪ And soar through the sky ♪

00:00:47.015 --> 00:00:50.357
♪ Smoke appears in
conflicted dimensions ♪

00:00:50.669 --> 00:00:53.307
♪ Waiting for someone's arrival ♪

00:00:53.689 --> 00:00:58.234
♪ Protecting the unshakable
belief within us ♪

00:00:58.474 --> 00:01:00.372
♪ And never backs down ♪

00:01:01.007 --> 00:01:04.871
♪ The sacred fountain lays there ♪

00:01:05.312 --> 00:01:08.633
♪ Shocked by what had appeared
in front of us ♪

00:01:09.019 --> 00:01:12.065
♪ The star atlas has open
a path for our journey ♪

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:15.505
♪ Laughing while we watch
the world from above ♪

00:01:15.938 --> 00:01:19.040
♪ He had given me everything ♪

00:01:19.134 --> 00:01:23.218
♪ The truth in sight is unpleasant ♪

00:01:23.258 --> 00:01:25.980
♪ Anger that is insurmountable ♪

00:01:25.981 --> 00:01:30.389
♪ That unique soul was
born to be a hero ♪

00:01:30.532 --> 00:01:33.659
♪ The torrential rain can't be
stopped by the hot-blooded ♪

00:01:33.699 --> 00:01:37.584
♪ The chosen one will not
bid farewell easily ♪

00:01:37.606 --> 00:01:40.449
♪ I will create a miracle ♪

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:45.986
♪ With the burning fire
in my wounded heart ♪

00:01:46.193 --> 00:01:50.284
♪ I promise ♪

00:01:56.813 --> 00:01:58.704
Stay away from me!

00:01:59.667 --> 00:02:00.387
Stay away from me!

00:02:09.353 --> 00:02:11.861
Boss, my uncle's house is
at the alley up front.

00:02:12.525 --> 00:02:13.805
We should hide in there now.

00:02:14.516 --> 00:02:16.489
The street is full of monsters.

00:02:17.546 --> 00:02:19.652
Fine. You mean the alley ahead?

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:22.490
Let's go.

00:03:41.675 --> 00:03:44.104
What exactly happened here?

00:03:44.847 --> 00:03:47.271
Code blood is in effect.

00:03:47.581 --> 00:03:49.741
That is the highest level of alert!

00:03:49.934 --> 00:03:52.214
It means we are invaded
by thousands of monsters.

00:03:53.608 --> 00:03:55.141
I have never seen this before.

00:03:55.441 --> 00:03:57.561
I always thought that
was just a precaution.

00:03:58.437 --> 00:03:59.383
I've never thought...

00:03:59.991 --> 00:04:01.138
it really happened.

00:04:03.404 --> 00:04:06.009
Dame it, I hope my father
and Xinxia are all right.

00:04:20.007 --> 00:04:20.887
Hide in here!

00:04:20.908 --> 00:04:22.576
Hurry up before you
get yourselves killed!

00:04:48.419 --> 00:04:49.392
Close the door!

00:04:50.292 --> 00:04:52.564
Do you want to get us killed?
Close the door.

00:04:52.858 --> 00:04:54.789
There are still people out there.

00:04:54.803 --> 00:04:56.302
We couldn't care so much right now.

00:04:56.569 --> 00:04:58.951
Close the door before
all of us here die!

00:05:02.621 --> 00:05:03.745
Stand aside!

00:05:15.072 --> 00:05:16.312
This place is not safe either.

00:05:16.644 --> 00:05:19.701
If we head to the underground market,
we have heavy steel doors for shelter.

00:05:26.754 --> 00:05:27.848
Where are you going now?

00:05:29.084 --> 00:05:31.977
Don't be silly, I am going
to my father and Xinxia.

00:05:33.082 --> 00:05:35.826
Wait, I need to ask you a favor.

00:05:39.068 --> 00:05:41.449
Make sure it reaches
the safety barrier.

00:05:42.159 --> 00:05:43.052
The Sacred Spring?

00:05:47.319 --> 00:05:48.505
Why are you handing it to me?

00:05:48.992 --> 00:05:51.006
My status is not convenient
for the task.

00:05:51.766 --> 00:05:53.951
It's harder for people to know
if you carry this.

00:05:54.392 --> 00:05:55.765
With our current military strength,

00:05:55.858 --> 00:05:58.484
we are no match for
the monster invasion.

00:05:58.672 --> 00:05:59.698
I am a Military Mage.

00:06:00.071 --> 00:06:03.385
The Bow City may be invaded,
but my fight is not over yet.

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:05.350
You must protect the Sacred Spring.

00:06:06.007 --> 00:06:08.221
If the Black Curia get
their hands on this,

00:06:09.049 --> 00:06:10.689
it would be a disaster for the world.

00:06:26.806 --> 00:06:29.236
I don't care about the Sacred Spring.

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:32.778
I don't even know if my family
is dead or alive.

00:06:33.464 --> 00:06:37.095
They must still be alive, I can't
just leave them out there.

00:06:39.603 --> 00:06:40.870
You are not the only one with family.

00:06:42.836 --> 00:06:46.129
What about the guards that protect
the Sacred Spring?

00:06:47.023 --> 00:06:49.090
Because they gave it their all
to protect the Spring,

00:06:49.437 --> 00:06:51.237
you got the time to run away!

00:06:52.493 --> 00:06:53.707
I once had a family too.

00:06:54.489 --> 00:06:55.529
But a year ago,

00:06:55.956 --> 00:06:57.745
a Cyclops took my sister.

00:07:01.138 --> 00:07:03.917
It's the same on that day.
I was on a mission.

00:07:04.308 --> 00:07:06.108
But I didn't abandon my mission.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.200
Because I know what is
the right thing to do.

00:07:08.859 --> 00:07:10.179
Because I am a mage.

00:07:10.798 --> 00:07:11.944
Aren't you a mage too?

00:07:26.758 --> 00:07:29.165
If you run into them in the city,

00:07:29.798 --> 00:07:31.078
take care of them for me.

00:07:31.694 --> 00:07:34.075
-Please.
-You have my word.

00:07:59.855 --> 00:08:01.969
Son, stay safe.

00:08:02.036 --> 00:08:02.925
Stay safe!

00:08:07.832 --> 00:08:08.739
Brother Mu He?

00:08:09.243 --> 00:08:10.510
Why are you here?

00:08:11.005 --> 00:08:12.045
Brother Jiaxing?

00:08:12.584 --> 00:08:13.530
It's you.

00:08:13.973 --> 00:08:14.639
Good.

00:08:14.862 --> 00:08:17.767
I was headed to the safety barrier.
My car broke down.

00:08:18.157 --> 00:08:20.517
I glad I ran into you here. Let's go.

00:08:20.831 --> 00:08:21.951
I must head to the downtown.

00:08:22.922 --> 00:08:25.620
The street is crawling with monsters,
why would go there?

00:08:26.426 --> 00:08:28.847
-I must save Mo Fan.
-Mo Fan?

00:08:29.633 --> 00:08:31.647
Right. He is at the Sacred Spring.

00:08:32.099 --> 00:08:35.366
Don't bother going there. That was
the first place to be attacked.

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:37.054
What do you mean?

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:39.593
We should go to the safety barrier.

00:08:40.231 --> 00:08:42.897
Only people that go there
will survive this crisis.

00:08:44.258 --> 00:08:45.577
If Mo Fan is still alive,

00:08:46.234 --> 00:08:47.421
he would go there as well.

00:08:48.004 --> 00:08:50.623
You can either get off the car
or come with me to the downtown.

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:51.860
You...

00:08:55.417 --> 00:08:57.372
Fine. Suit yourself.

00:08:57.661 --> 00:08:58.301
Just go.

00:09:10.415 --> 00:09:12.388
The cursed rain finally stopped.

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:14.216
The Spring of Rage.

00:09:14.433 --> 00:09:15.753
I was too careless.

00:09:16.791 --> 00:09:18.789
Report! Sir,

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:22.050
the situation is spreading,
the number of casualty is rising.

00:09:25.121 --> 00:09:25.894
Sir?

00:09:26.434 --> 00:09:29.016
-I am going into the city.
-We need you to be our commander.

00:09:29.612 --> 00:09:30.399
I should go instead.

00:09:30.964 --> 00:09:33.825
Sorry, I am counting on you.

00:09:34.119 --> 00:09:36.401
I will protect the city even if
I must give up my life.

00:09:37.319 --> 00:09:38.173
No.

00:09:39.798 --> 00:09:42.492
Come back in one piece, Yang Zuohe.

00:09:55.924 --> 00:09:57.244
Water Magic-Protection?

00:09:58.065 --> 00:09:59.598
It won't hold much longer.

00:10:01.037 --> 00:10:03.250
I wonder how are Zhang Xiaohou
and the others.

00:10:06.141 --> 00:10:07.818
Run!

00:10:08.225 --> 00:10:08.905
Run!

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:20.625
No! Wave Plane Shift!

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:24.533
Wave Plane Shift!

00:10:25.034 --> 00:10:27.089
Wave Plane Shift!

00:11:05.911 --> 00:11:07.905
Fire Hiss, Raging Fire!

00:11:20.805 --> 00:11:21.632
Mu Bai?

00:11:23.824 --> 00:11:25.186
Take this, for protection.

00:11:25.252 --> 00:11:26.105
During close quarter,

00:11:26.513 --> 00:11:29.020
not everyone can stay calm
and release a magic.

00:11:29.967 --> 00:11:30.687
Come with me.

00:11:40.326 --> 00:11:41.033
Stop.

00:11:42.677 --> 00:11:44.346
Are we just going to leave them?

00:11:44.589 --> 00:11:46.473
Calm down,
don't get yourself killed too.

00:11:47.647 --> 00:11:48.261
Come on.

00:11:54.292 --> 00:11:56.161
Don't eat me, I am not eatable!

00:11:56.168 --> 00:11:57.910
Mu Bai! Help!

00:12:03.479 --> 00:12:05.647
Congealing Ice!

00:12:09.673 --> 00:12:12.467
-Are there any Cyclops upstairs?
-Yes!

00:12:12.793 --> 00:12:14.915
It can't be helped.
Head to the stadium.

00:12:25.283 --> 00:12:26.403
Blinding Gleam!

00:12:30.999 --> 00:12:31.786
Are you all right?

00:12:45.717 --> 00:12:47.251
Wave Plane Collapse!

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:52.413
Oh no, I could do it on
the class the other day!

00:12:52.414 --> 00:12:54.472
You are not in a class,
this is the real deal.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:13.883
See? That is the real deal.

00:13:28.971 --> 00:13:30.720
Don't be afraid, I will get you out.

00:13:45.448 --> 00:13:46.488
Do you believe me?

00:14:00.538 --> 00:14:01.552
Wind Magic.

00:14:02.914 --> 00:14:03.794
Flash!

00:14:40.228 --> 00:14:41.215
Zhang Xiaohou!

00:14:42.893 --> 00:14:43.786
Run!

00:14:44.291 --> 00:14:45.317
He Yu!

00:14:46.474 --> 00:14:47.994
Just leave me!

00:14:49.567 --> 00:14:52.913
No, Zhang Xiaohou!

00:14:55.553 --> 00:14:56.371
Run!

00:14:57.924 --> 00:14:59.244
Zhang Xiaohou!

00:14:59.687 --> 00:15:00.901
Zhang Xiaohou!

00:15:01.088 --> 00:15:02.886
Thunder Magic, Serpent!

00:15:19.657 --> 00:15:21.107
Yo, Xiaohou,

00:15:21.134 --> 00:15:22.450
He Yu, are you all right?

00:15:22.451 --> 00:15:23.308
Brother Fan!

00:15:33.104 --> 00:15:34.837
That thing is still alive.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:37.350
Thunder Magic, Serpent!

00:15:41.015 --> 00:15:43.492
Brother Fan, I will break through
his defence,

00:15:43.577 --> 00:15:44.857
end it with your magic.

00:15:52.625 --> 00:15:53.439
Wind Magic.

00:15:56.662 --> 00:15:57.915
Now is your chance!

00:15:58.161 --> 00:16:00.465
Hiss of Fire, Raging Fire!

00:16:08.649 --> 00:16:10.451
He is amazing.

00:16:18.827 --> 00:16:20.334
That was so close.

00:16:20.652 --> 00:16:23.383
Brother Fan, I am so glad
to see you again.

00:16:25.089 --> 00:16:26.806
Shouldn't you be training
at the Sacred Spring?

00:16:26.859 --> 00:16:28.326
Now is not the time for chitchat.

00:16:29.226 --> 00:16:30.986
The situation is worse than I thought.

00:16:42.144 --> 00:16:44.611
Where did all these monsters come from?

00:16:46.294 --> 00:16:46.947
Let's go.

00:16:47.213 --> 00:16:48.907
The others are in the stadium.

00:17:09.303 --> 00:17:11.678
♪ Pressing onward courageously ♪

00:17:12.381 --> 00:17:15.791
♪ With the burning dreams in our heart ♪

00:17:16.061 --> 00:17:19.112
♪ We are reminiscing
the dreams of our past ♪

00:17:19.753 --> 00:17:21.233
♪ And it gives me strength ♪

00:17:21.634 --> 00:17:23.527
♪ The most stubborn wings ♪

00:17:24.141 --> 00:17:27.187
♪ Dreamt that we will
not wander anymore ♪

00:17:27.519 --> 00:17:31.444
♪ And hoped that we will
fly further one day ♪

00:17:32.917 --> 00:17:36.842
♪ With the dim lights
shining through the sky ♪

00:17:37.835 --> 00:17:42.782
♪ Shine through our heart
and fill in the ups and downs ♪

00:17:43.843 --> 00:17:47.104
♪ I'm as proud as the sun ♪

00:17:47.416 --> 00:17:50.270
♪ The clouds are moving
in the distance ♪

00:17:50.537 --> 00:17:52.862
♪ Since I have decided to be unique ♪

00:17:53.005 --> 00:17:55.913
♪ I will break all barriers
and shine through ♪

00:17:56.238 --> 00:17:58.960
♪ Life is ever-changing ♪

00:17:59.095 --> 00:18:02.512
♪ But I will soar through the sky ♪

00:18:02.838 --> 00:18:04.807
♪ The hope that is beating within me ♪

00:18:05.379 --> 00:18:08.476
♪ Writes a new chapter for me ♪

00:18:09.021 --> 00:18:12.860
♪ We will battle once more
if we have the chance ♪

00:18:13.448 --> 00:18:19.685
♪ To be the everlasting light
in the world ♪
